<title>USA: Twin Disc Inc Q1 Sept 30 net up.</title>
<headline>Twin Disc Inc Q1 Sept 30 net up.</headline>
<dateline>RACINE, Wis. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.41		   $ 0.08</p>
<p> Net			  1,132			221</p>
<p> Revs			40,941		   36,775</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net includes various non-recurring items including inventory of a discontinued product line that was written off while prior-year operations were charged with the cost of a voluntary separation program. Excluding non-recurring items, net was $950,000 vs $760,000.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
